DE AUGOSTOS INVESTMENTS - Warranty Terms & Conditions
======================================================

1. All services and parts supplied by DE AUGOSTOS INVESTMENTS
   are covered by a warranty period as specified on the invoice.

2. Warranty covers manufacturing defects and workmanship errors
   only. It does not cover wear and tear, misuse, or negligence.

3. Warranty Periods:
   - Parts: 6 months from date of installation
   - Labour: 3 months from date of service
   - Major engine/transmission work: 12 months

4. Warranty claims must be submitted within 7 days of
   discovering the issue.

5. DE AUGOSTOS INVESTMENTS reserves the right to inspect
   the vehicle before approving any warranty claim.

6. Warranty is void if:
   - The vehicle has been serviced by unauthorized personnel
   - Non-genuine parts have been used
   - The vehicle has been modified without approval

For warranty claims, contact:
+267 71 234 567 | info@deaugostosinvestments.co.bw
